📊 8. Mean, Median, Mode

# Mean, Median, Mode
l=[2,4,4,6,8]
mean=sum(l)/len(l)
l.sort()
median=l[len(l)//2]
mode=max(l,key=l.count)
print("Mean:",mean)
print("Median:",median)
print("Mode:",mode)

Output:

Mean: 4.8
Median: 4
Mode: 4


